 relationship?<br>From a first-person perspective, you'll start an interactive relationship with these sweet and beautiful ladies in a variety of realistic scenarios, and finally choose your Happy Ending!<br>We hope this immersive love light comedy satisfies you emotionally and offers you a break for your heart<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Features</h2>- First-person perspective view, immersive experience<br>Live action and live interpretation, enjoy those scenes of being in love at a close distance<br><br>- Diverse options <br>Free choice of your own relationship genre - gentle, tough, flattering, funny<br>Setting aside a standard answer, do not worry about picking the wrong one, just follow your heart!<br><br>- Multiple branches and endings<br>Depending on your choices, the story will come to an end, all choices are yours!<br>Rich story line, chapter mode, solo mode, and achievement system all cater to your desire for exploration<br><br>- Enjoy your relationship without efforts and bothersome <br>NO indifference, NO unrequited love, NO slow starter, NO loss<br>Super active, Super interactive, Super passionate, Super satisfying.<br><br>- Rich bonus, Rich highlights<br>A selection of exciting moments and highlights is stored in an album waiting to be unlocked for you to review in your spare time<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With visual novel elements, interactive selection function.<br></li><li>Full motion video from a first-person perspective<br></li><li>Game duration 4 hours +<br></li><li>Clear Process Tree<br></li><li>Loading function<br></li><li>Achievement system<br></li><li>Gallery function<br></li><li>Multi-language</li></ul>",
